  <!-- Interface strings, English.

       Consumed through DynamicResource rather than StaticResource: that is
       what makes the language switch immediate, with no restart and no need to
       reopen windows.

       EVERY key declared here must exist in Strings.fr.xaml. A missing key
       yields an EMPTY label, with no error and no clue about the cause.

       H_ keys are the tooltips, formerly in Help.cs. Writing rule: say what
       happens when the setting is wrong, do not repeat the field label. -->


